        <briefdescription>
<para>Runs one command line from a <computeroutput>run</computeroutput> request, and sends the result to the client. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The request names the folder and the arguments. The folder must be an absolute path that can be set as the working folder. Otherwise the call sends a tool error. The result holds the exit code, the output, and the errors. The bytes of the output documents are read in place and sent as one text. When that text is not valid UTF-8, the bytes are sent as one base64 text instead. The failures are sent as diagnostic lines, under the same rule.</para>
