    <briefdescription>
<para>MCP server on standard input and output, with one tool that runs saw command lines. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The tool <computeroutput>run</computeroutput> runs one saw command line in a folder. The server holds no state between calls, except the process working folder that each call sets. Closing the input ends the process. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
